      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "How to read changes from the WHO IRIS DSpace 7 REST API: the nightly \"changed since\" walk over Discovery sorted by lastModified, the weekly reconciliation that stands in for the deletions REST does not report, and the guard that stops a short listing from reading as a mass withdrawal."
